22:45.070 --> 22:46.800
Bisakah Adipati menolong aku?

22:47.480 --> 22:49.610
Bisakah menyelamatkan nyawa ayahku?

22:53.790 --> 22:55.450
Tentang masalah Zhuang Shen,

22:55.580 --> 22:58.810
[Aula Songcheng]

22:56.310 --> 22:57.720
