27:32.830 --> 27:34.360
Aku datang demi Chengyang.

27:34.920 --> 27:36.350
Demi Chengyang.

27:38.750 --> 27:39.440
Kenapa?

27:40.400 --> 27:42.330
Mendengar kabar Pangeran Pertama

27:43.070 --> 27:45.200
