Aku... sudah...

32:33.030 --> 32:34.270
Ampun...

32:41.640 --> 32:43.480
Selamatkan Ge...

32:44.000 --> 32:44.790
Selamat...

33:39.220 --> 33:39.950
Permaisuri.

33:40.720 --> 33:41.550
Hamba

33:42.280 --> 33:44.480
